{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "44245896",
      "title": "Moving the Action Function out of the Component",
      "sourceHash": "6881d1007d8f78a88e9ba0646f85b7cd3b84007937e72f021aeb1aba9b422d07",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.13,
          "end": 3.78,
          "en": "So now at this point",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.78,
          "end": 6.81,
          "en": "you learned the basics of form actions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.81,
          "end": 8.28,
          "en": "You learned how you can set up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.28,
          "end": 10.98,
          "en": "and use a synchronous form action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.98,
          "end": 14.7,
          "en": "So a form action that does not use async await",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.7,
          "end": 16.44,
          "en": "or return a promise,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.44,
          "end": 20.073,
          "en": "and you learned how to work with the useActionState hook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.03,
          "end": 24.24,
          "en": "Now there is more, and we will move on",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.24,
          "end": 26.76,
          "en": "to a more advanced example in just a second,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.76,
          "end": 28.29,
          "en": "but before we do that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.29,
          "end": 31.05,
          "en": "there's one other important thing you should know",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.05,
          "end": 32.82,
          "en": "about form actions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 32.82,
          "end": 36.348,
          "en": "You don't have to create these action functions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.348,
          "end": 39.03,
          "en": "inside of a component function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.03,
          "end": 43.53,
          "en": "You can, as you see here, but you don't have to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.53,
          "end": 47.609,
          "en": "If in this action function you are not using",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 47.609,
          "end": 52.609,
          "en": "any component specific data, so if you're not using props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 52.86,
          "end": 55.08,
          "en": "or some state in here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 55.08,
          "end": 58.03,
          "en": "you can absolutely take this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 59.22,
          "end": 62.7,
          "en": "and move it out of this component function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 62.7,
          "end": 64.65,
          "en": "So that's what I did here now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 64.65,
          "end": 68.28,
          "en": "I grabbed this signupAction function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 68.28,
          "end": 71.14,
          "en": "and I moved it right below my imports",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 72.18,
          "end": 74.61,
          "en": "outside of the component function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 74.61,
          "end": 77.223,
          "en": "so that the component function is leaner.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 79.53,
          "end": 82.86,
          "en": "And of course, you could also store this action function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 82.86,
          "end": 86.31,
          "en": "in a totally different file if you wanted to do that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 86.31,
          "end": 89.763,
          "en": "It doesn't have to be in the same file as the component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 90.69,
          "end": 92.46000000000001,
          "en": "And especially moving it out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 92.46000000000001,
          "end": 95.88,
          "en": "of the component function can make sense from a performance",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 95.88,
          "end": 99.84,
          "en": "perspective because if the action function is inside",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 99.84,
          "end": 102.47999999999999,
          "en": "of the component, the action function will",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 102.47999999999999,
          "end": 105.21000000000001,
          "en": "of course be recreated every time",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 105.21000000000001,
          "end": 107.94,
          "en": "the component function executes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 107.94,
          "end": 111.09,
          "en": "Now, this is not necessarily a big problem,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 111.09,
          "end": 114.72,
          "en": "but it could become a problem depending on the complexity",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 114.72,
          "end": 115.86,
          "en": "of your application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 115.86,
          "end": 120.27,
          "en": "and how often this component function is being re-executed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 120.27,
          "end": 123.21,
          "en": "And therefore moving the action function out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 123.21,
          "end": 125.46,
          "en": "of it if you don't need it to be inside",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 125.46,
          "end": 128.283,
          "en": "of the component function can make sense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 129.48,
          "end": 132.15,
          "en": "Of course, if you were using props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 132.15,
          "end": 136.23,
          "en": "or state in that action function, you would have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 136.23,
          "end": 138.96,
          "en": "to move it back into the component function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 138.96,
          "end": 142.62,
          "en": "so that you have access to those props or state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 142.62,
          "end": 144.48,
          "en": "But here, that's not the case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 144.48,
          "end": 146.853,
          "en": "So moving it out of there makes sense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 148.41,
          "end": 150.42000000000002,
          "en": "And with that, we can now move on",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 150.42000000000002,
          "end": 152.28300000000002,
          "en": "to the more advanced features.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}